# TASK-217 — Setup.svelte focused diff (Saber frontend)

NOTE: `src/screens/Setup.svelte` was ALREADY dirty in the working tree with
prior TASK-208 (recover wizard) uncommitted work before TASK-217 started.
`git diff src/screens/Setup.svelte` therefore shows a ~1456-line diff against
HEAD that mixes TASK-208 + TASK-217 changes.

This file shows ONLY the TASK-217 changes (multi-mint restore), as four
focused hunks, so the delta attributable to TASK-217 is unambiguous.

---

## Hunk 1 — import getAllMintConfigs (line 30)

```diff
-	import { setActiveMintUrl, getActiveMintUrl } from '$lib/wallet/store';
+	import { setActiveMintUrl, getAllMintConfigs } from '$lib/wallet/store';
```

(`getActiveMintUrl` was only used by the old single-mint `restoreFunds()` and
is no longer needed.)

